# Build context for backend/Dockerfile and backend-cit/Dockerfile is the repo
# root (their compose files use `context: ..`). Allowlist only what Go needs.
# Frontends build from their own folder and use their own .dockerignore.
*
!go.work
!go.work.sum
!pkg/
!backend/
!backend-cit/

# Never ship secrets or local build output, even inside allowed folders.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/bin/
**/*.exe
**/*.test
**/*.out
**/*.md
